   "division": null,
   "number": "25",
   "heading": "Requirement to give reasons",
   "text": "The general manager must give to an applicant written reasons for the following decisions: (a) refusing to accept an application to issue, renew, transfer or amend a licence; (b) refusing to issue, renew, transfer or amend a licence."
