   "text": "(1) Documents required or allowed under this Act to be given or served on a person must be given or served in accordance with the regulations. (2) A document given or served in accordance with subsection (1) is conclusively deemed to be received, in relation to a specified method of service, as provided in the regulations."
  },
  {
