   "part": null,
   "division": null,
   "number": "124",
   "heading": "Proof of compliance by general manager or director",
   "text": "In a prosecution or proceeding in respect of any matter arising under this Act, an affidavit of the general manager or director setting out the facts necessary to establish compliance with this Act by the general manager or director is proof of those facts."
  },
  {
